  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>OVER WI-FI</b>

    1. Put the PC and the headset on the same Wi-Fi.

    2. On the PC open Command Prompt and run <b>ipconfig</b>. Note the IPv4 Address of the Wi-Fi adapter.

    3. Type it on the Satellite Data page, keep port 8100, press <b>Connect</b>.

    <color=#7D8896>If it won''t link, allow TCP 8100 and 8101 through Windows Firewall.</color>


    <b>OVER A USB CABLE</b>

    1. Plug the headset into the PC and accept USB debugging inside the headset.

    2. On the PC run: <b>adb reverse tcp:8100 tcp:8100</b>

    3. Press <b>USB Cable</b> on the Satellite Data page.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
